    <h1>The full toolkit, <em>in plain language.</em></h1>
    <p>You should know exactly what is running your website. This is every tool I use, what it does for you, and why I picked it over the popular alternative. There are no secret ingredients. If something here is unfamiliar, the <a href="/glossary/" class="inline-link">glossary</a> defines it.</p>
